  "description": "Taukeer Alam sings a couplet from a wedding song and talks in Van Gujjari about Van Gujjar wedding songs. Subhashish Panigrahi recorded him in Dehradun, Uttarakhand, India, in 2019 for his 2021 documentary MarginalizedAadhaar. The footage wasn't used in the film, and it was edited and published under the मारी जबान मारी बिरसा (Maari Jaban Maari Birsa) project in 2024. Van Gujjari and Hindi subtitles are by Alam, and the English translation is by Panigrahi.",
